{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36847","headline":"昇平公主旧第 · 罗隐","name":"昇平公主旧第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘凤仙人降此时，玉篇才罢到文词。\n两轮水磑光明照，百尺鲛绡换好诗。\n带砺山河今尽在，风流罇俎见无期。\n坛场客散香街暝，惆怅齐竽取次吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}